00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.160
Some of the Things You Missed in this trailer
point to this being the darkest Purge movie

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.160
yet.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:12.290
If you want to see what I mean, then stick
around to the end of this video.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:15.070
One of the things that's always left me wanting
more with the Purge movies is that they're

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:16.710
so focused on murder.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:21.410
I mean come on, the rules of the Purge state
that all crime will be legal for 12 hours.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:24.760
I mean sure, there's that girl who wants to
steal a candy bar or whatever in Election

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:29.320
Year, but where are all the vandals, trespassers,
kidnappers, drug doers and other criminals

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:30.960
that don't involve murder?

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.030
In my mind, that's the fun stuff that I'd
want to be doing on Purge night.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:37.800
It looks like this prequel may help explain
why we don't see a lot of that stuff in subsequent

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:38.800
Purges.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.719
One of the first images we see is this chick
on a swing in an industrial looking building.

00:00:42.719 --> 00:00:45.270
If you pause you'll see she's in a high voltage
area.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:48.780
And a lot of the other images we see from
the beginning of this First Purge, just seem

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.760
to be young people blowing things up, doing
shenanigans, and even just holding crazy parties

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:54.219
in the street with no consequences.

00:00:54.219 --> 00:00:56.800
None of them seem to have very malicious intent.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.829
So the President, and this woman who came
up with the idea for the Purge, are monitoring

00:01:00.829 --> 00:01:05.339
these activities, and the President seems
disappointed that more people aren't getting

00:01:05.339 --> 00:01:06.339
violent.

00:01:06.339 --> 00:01:07.339
"Parties?

00:01:07.339 --> 00:01:09.119
You predicted a much higher level of participation."

00:01:09.119 --> 00:01:13.400
Because remember, one of the main conspiracies
from the three existing Purge films is that

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.680
The Purge is just a way for the government
to clean up their streets by killing off the

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.600
poor, who are the ones who are most vulnerable
during The Purge.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:23.650
In order to go through with this agenda, the
President tampers with the experiment by artifically

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.580
introducing murder into the equation.

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:30.299
"You're sending soldiers into the island disguised
as citizens?"

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:34.400
This President is corrupt, and he's using
this Staten Island Purge experiment as a front

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.920
for the American public to convince them that
the Purge is helping the country, so that

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:39.240
he can get what he wants.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:43.159
The New Founding Fathers of America, or the
NFFA, are the political party that supports

00:01:43.159 --> 00:01:47.030
the Purge, and this President is most likely
their first member to gain power.

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:51.510
He even replaces the United States coat of
arms flag in the oval office with this flag,

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:55.509
which looks to have the last two letters from
the acronym NFFA along with a preliminary

00:01:55.509 --> 00:01:56.509
version of the logo.

00:01:56.509 --> 00:02:00.180
He also wears an NFFA pin right next to his
American flag.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:03.790
There's evidence that he's going to be manipulating
The Purge in more ways than one.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.430
Since this Purge is just an experiment, it's
outcome could greatly affect the possibility

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:09.789
of the future country-wide Purges taking place.

00:02:09.789 --> 00:02:14.000
And since this one just takes place in the
isolated environment on Staten Island, the

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.140
President is gonna want to be able to control
the perception of the experiment by the rest

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:18.710
of the American people.

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:23.000
Throughout the trailer there are these broadcasts
by a channel called CNB, which is mostly likely

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:27.991
a play on CNN, which stands for cable news
network, so I imagine CNB stands for Cable

00:02:27.991 --> 00:02:29.459
News Broadcast or something.

00:02:29.459 --> 00:02:32.319
Throughout the trailer, they are the only
ones who are covering to the events of the

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:37.060
Purge, including live broadcasts from inside
the Purge and propaganda to convince the public

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:40.510
that there is no political agenda behind the
controversial holiday.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:42.330
"Is The Purge a political device?"

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.080
"It is a psychological one.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:47.720
If we want to save our country we must release
all our anger in one night."

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:51.849
Seeing as how The Purge movies have tied themselves
in with current political movements in America,

00:02:51.849 --> 00:02:56.360
I wouldn't be surprised if this CNB network
took a page out of CNNs book and became involved

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.090
