00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:02.599
They could even be a pawn of the NFFA used
to make the American think what their government

00:03:02.599 --> 00:03:03.930
wants them to think.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:07.370
Of course, there's always going to be backlash,
which brings us to our main character.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:10.280
It seems like she's already a rebellious voice
in her community.

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:13.480
Before the announcement of The Purge, she's
already got this megaphone, which we later

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.790
see her use at the Purge protests.

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.739
The protests have some interesting signage.

00:03:17.739 --> 00:03:21.480
We see more references to the current real
life American political standing, like this

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:25.620
