00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:41.160
So what does this mean?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:44.840
Currently the USA has a Constitution with
27 amendments, or 27 rules.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:48.239
In this movie, it looks like The Purge will
